~ start
if not StoryFlags.met_fake_robot
	=> first_dialogue
else
	=> nothing_to_say

~ first_dialogue
???: Hey kid
Roadie: Who are you?
???: That depends, you own this joint?
Roadie: No, that guy just died. Like less than 2 hours ago or something
???: You inheriting the joint?
Roadie: No. Again, who are you?
Robot?: I am the Gnosh Network's Original V1. Food review HUMAN, NOT ROBOT
Robot?: Who reviewed the food
Robot?: BEFORE THE BOTS DID
Roadie: Well, i'm the detective for this mess, and i'll be asking some questions
Robot?: You? Solve all this? We're gonna be here all night
Roadie: Why are you in a cardboard robot costume?
Robot?: I wanted my job back and thought that maybe if I looked the part they'd take me back
Robot?: Y'now, like the robot tv star thing is just what the people want to see
Robot?: And if I can play a robot convincingly enough they'd put me back on air
Roadie: Good luck with that
$> StoryFlags.met_fake_robot = true
=> END

~ nothing_to_say
Robot?: You got a question for me? I didn't do anything, just been watching that robot all night
Roadie: Not yet...
Robot?: Well, then move along pal
=> END

~ default_pizza
Robot?: Not much of a pizza fan
Roadie: You used to do televised food reviews and you don't like pizza?
Robot?: Ever heard of how actors spit food out between takes because they do like 500 of them?
Roadie: ...
Robot?: It's not about the food, its about the camera prescence kid
Roadie: Nothing to say about the case?
Robot?: Move along pal
=> END

~ bolt_pizza
Robot?: HEY I TOLD YOU TO KEEP THAT AWAY FROM ME
Roadie: Keep this away? This pizza right here?
Robot?: I'm NOT SOME KINDA BOT PAL DON'T FEED ME THAT
Roadie: What about a little? Just a little bite? Here try it
Robot?: AW HELL NAH! GET OUT OF HERE KID!
Roadie: >=)
=> END

~ have_bolts
Robot?: You putting bolts on pizza kid?
Roadie: No, at least not yet. Maybe if I get really bored
Robot?: Well don't feed one to me pal, noooooooooo thank you. I don't like pizza
Roadie: or bolts?
Robot?: Especially pizza. With bolts.
Roadie: Know anyone who would?
Robot?: I think we know who would kid, either him or me
Roadie: Him?
Robot?: Move along pal
=> END

~ harrys_devils
Robot?: Kid, I gotta tell you something before the investigation moves further
Roadie: Yes?
Robot?: Can you frame that kid with the angel and the devil on his shoulder for the murder?
Roadie: What?
Robot?: Those little devils are nothing but trouble! They've been a pain in my posterior ever since I came in
Robot?: They were pulling on my disguise and harassing me! There used to be a foam finger on this hand you know that?
Robot?: Not anymore! They ripped it off and threw it out the window! Now it must be all soggy outside in a gutter while i'm locked in here!
Roadie: I'm not going to frame them, but thanks for the info anyways.
=> END